# Optional local overrides for `make dev-ephemeral`.
# Process env always wins over .env. This file is gitignored when named `.env`.
#
# Preferred local setup: in 1Password desktop, mount an Environment at this path
# (Developer → Environments → local .env). That mount is a FIFO; do not replace
# it with a plaintext file if you want 1Password to keep managing it.
#
# Headless SDK bootstrap (only needed when the local .env is incomplete):
# OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID=envs/...
# OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN=ops_...   # full token; must start with ops_
# OP_ACCOUNT=my.1password.account    # alternative to service account token
#
# Feature keys can also live here directly:
# CONTROLPLANE_GITHUB_APP_ID=...
# CONTROLPLANE_GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...
# CONTROLPLANE_GITHUB_PRIVATE_KEY_PEM=...
# CONTROLPLANE_REGISTRY_HOST=...
# CONTROLPLANE_REGISTRY_USERNAME=...
# CONTROLPLANE_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=...
# DASHBOARD_GITHUB_APP_ID=...
# DASHBOARD_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
# DASHBOARD_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...
# CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=...
# CLOUDFLARE_HOSTNAME=...
